   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Start here\n\nLoad a picture, turn the wheels, queue. Nothing is sampled and no checkpoint is loaded, so the result comes back immediately — this is the fastest way to learn what each wheel does.\n\n**Lift** moves the shadows and leaves white alone. **Gain** moves the highlights and leaves black alone. **Gamma** bends everything in between. The bar under each disc is that range's brightness.\n\nDrag the handle — it moves *with* the pointer rather than jumping to it, so small corrections are possible. Hold **Shift** for fine control, **Alt-click** to reset one wheel.\n\nRight-click the node for presets, and for saving the current settings as one of your own."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
